Pramana Protocol
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Repository: https://github.com/vinaysflow/pramana-protocol
License:    GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (AGPL-3.0)
Copyright:  (c) 2026 Aurvia Global / Vinay Tripathi

Pramana Protocol provides the foundational identity, credentials, delegation,
audit, and commerce infrastructure that Kavach Platform consumes via the
public `pramana` Python SDK boundary. Kavach Platform contains NO Pramana
Protocol source code. Kavach Platform interacts with Pramana Protocol solely
through the public API surface exposed by the `pramana` PyPI package (or its
equivalent during local development via editable install).

The full legal and architectural analysis of the IP separation between
Pramana Protocol and Kavach Platform is documented in `docs/ip-provenance.md`
(added in a subsequent W01-S02 block).

